5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Perhaps we should ensure these wonderful proposals are practically feasible before we decide?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Theoretical brilliance is useless if the project lacks the actual hands to execute the work.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"We must also consider the shared infrastructure. If the facilities are overstretched, the most promising research will simply stall.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent suggestion. I am curious if the current grant's purchasing power actually aligns with the operational costs these researchers are projecting.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with everyone. I'm worried about non-scientific interruptions that often go unnoticed until it's too late. We should check where delays usually happen.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very thoughtful point, Midori. Shall we divide the records among us to see where the bottlenecks might be?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,That is the most efficient approach. I will focus on the human element—who is actually available to work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the shared facilities and their current state of availability.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall examine the financial ledgers and the computing agreements. I suspect the ""hidden"" costs are where the real risks lie.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I would like to look into the field site records and the portfolio of schedule overruns to see what typically causes delays.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the closeout files of finished awards and the repository turnaround. I want to see what actually reaches the finish line.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,That covers the output. I will stick to the staffing and secondment records.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I believe that is a comprehensive plan.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A little administrative detective work now saves us from a public failure later.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I feel much better knowing we are being so thorough. I'm looking forward to seeing what we find.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
